usage: vt12_macos_rndis.py [-h] [--seconds SECONDS] [--preview] [--record]
                           [--http-port HTTP_PORT] [--output OUTPUT]

VT12 userspace RNDIS video receiver; no kernel/network configuration changes.
Claims only the unbound RNDIS interfaces 0/1. Sends RNDIS initialization,
packet-filter control and ARP for 192.168.42.105; no robot/UDP control data.
Reuses the development kit's UDP recording, H.264 decoder and preview. RNDIS
wire structures: Linux include/linux/usb/rndis_host.h.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --seconds SECONDS
  --preview
  --record
  --http-port HTTP_PORT
  --output OUTPUT
